So I found one of those from the dungeon floor. Decided to pick it up,
so that I could perhaps make some holy water out of it later.

Around the next corner, three seconds later, I see what? A pyrolisk
and a floating eye! Two good reasons to be blind, right after I
discovered a potion for it! (Didn't have a towel or a blindfold yet).

Unfortunately, the floating eye didn't leave a corpse, which is why
the mumak that violently trampled me exactly three seconds after that
came as a compelete surprise.

I just thought the whole thing was a funny exercise about coincidence,
and that's why I'm posting it right now.


